      ],
      "content": "TRING                  LONDON ROAD SP 9211                                         (South side) 11/86                                   The Garden House - -                                       II House.  W range C17,  E range early C19.  Timber frame roughcast on rendered sill to W range, stucco on brickwork to E range, old red tile roofs steeper on W range. A 2-storeys house set back from road inside park boundary wall with front now on E. 2 parallel ranges side-by-side with older W range a 3-cells, internal chimney plan house with chimney 1/3 from S end and 4-light leaded flush casement on each floor on N gable.  Large chimney in valley between ranges at N end may have originated as a rear-wall chimney to older range. E front has 3 windows to 1st floor, 2 to ground floor and central door. Mullioned leaded casement windows with moulded labels, 3-:2-:3-light on 1st floor and 4-light on each side of door with pointed heads to lights above transom. 5-panel door with glazed and traceried top panel and Gothick rectangular fanlight within stucco surround. Listing NGR: SP9283311469"
    }
  ],
